# Nous Portal's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-nous-setting-token = A Nous Portal OAuth access token, used instead of Hermes Agent's login in ~/.hermes/auth.json (sign in with `hermes auth add nous`). It lasts about an hour; portal API keys are not accepted.
usage-nous-setting-base-url = An HTTPS portal origin such as https://portal.nousresearch.com, for a preview deployment. Plain HTTP is refused.

## The report: the subscription's monthly credits, top-up credits, and when
## the subscription renews. Plan and organization names, and the renewal
## date (such as Oct 12), stay as figures.

usage-nous-subscription-credits = Subscription credits
usage-nous-monthly-grant = Monthly grant
usage-nous-top-up-credits = Top-up credits
usage-nous-total-usable = Total usable
usage-nous-organization = Organization
usage-nous-rollover-credits = Rollover credits
usage-nous-renews = Renews
# A section's title, and the plan line of an active subscription that names
# no plan.
usage-nous-subscription = Subscription
